  "document": "The Lovers of Manon Lescaut\nThe Lovers of Manon Lescaut (Italian: Gli amori di Manon Lescaut) is a 1954 French-Italian historical melodrama film directed by Mario Costa and starring Myriam Bru, Franco Interlenghi and Roger Pigaut. It is based on the 1731 novel \"Manon Lescaut\" by Antoine François Prévost, which has been made into films on a number of occasions."
